What this repository contains
-----------------------------
  1. Modified versions of upstream source files
     (services/douchong-notify/patches/, services/douchong-report/danmaku_metrics.py).
     Each modified file keeps the original copyright notice and documents
     the changes applied, as required by GPL-2.0 §2(a) and §2(b).

  2. Original modules written by this project's maintainers, designed to be
     loaded into the VR_douchong process at runtime
     (services/douchong-notify/notify/, src/).

  3. A plain-text **stub** for the image-card renderer
     (services/douchong-notify/notify/dynamic_render.py). The full renderer is
     not part of this release; every caller already falls back to plain text
     when it returns None.

Not included in this release
----------------------------
  * The image-card renderer implementation
    (Bilibili-dynamic-style PNG cards).
  * The elaborated session-report layout (leaderboards, multi-section layout).
  * Bundled font assets.

  These are intentionally omitted. The extension remains fully functional in
  plain-text mode without them. See README.md for details.

